:"Robotics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For highly technical CAE careers, Computational Mechanics / Computational Engineering is particularly relevant."}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Structural CAE"},{"type":"p","text":"Stress, deformation, fatigue and dynamic analysis."},{"type":"h","text":"CFD Engineer"},{"type":"p","text":"Fluid flow, aerodynamics and heat transfer."},{"type":"h","text":"Thermal Simulation Engineer"},{"type":"p","text":"Battery, electronics, engine and cooling-system simulation."},{"type":"h","text":"Crash Simulation Engineer"},{"type":"p","text":"Impact, nonlinear dynamics and occupant safety."},{"type":"h","text":"NVH Engineer"},{"type":"p","text":"Noise, vibration and acoustics."},{"type":"h","text":"CAE Automation Engineer"},{"type":"flow","items":["CAE","Python","workflow automation."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"AI/ML for CAE Engineer"},{"type":"flow","items":["Simulation","machine learning","surrogate modelling","optimization."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Technical Track"},{"type":"flow","items":["CAE / Simulation Intern","Junior CAE Engineer","CAE Engineer","Senior CAE Engineer","CAE Technical Lead","Simulation Specialist / Architect","Principal CAE Engineer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Computational Engineering Track"},{"type":"flow","items":["CAE Engineer","Advanced Simulation Engineer","Computational Engineer","Simulation Specialist","Computational Engineering Architect","Principal / Distinguished Engineer"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The CAE industry is moving toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted simulation"},{"text":"Physics-informed neural networks"},{"text":"Surrogate modelling"},{"text":"Reduced-order models"},{"text":"Generative engineering"},{"text":"Topology optimization"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Cloud HPC"},{"text":"GPU-accelerated simu